{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50261","headline":"卫叔卿不宾汉武帝 · 李翔","name":"卫叔卿不宾汉武帝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"銮殿仙卿顿紫云，武皇非意欲相臣。\n便回太华三峰路，不喜咸阳万乘春。\n涉险漫劳中禁使，投壶多是上清人。\n犹教度世依方术，莫恋浮荣误尔身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}